Priority 1: Secure the Driver Order Updates

Problem: Currently, public/js/driver-dashboard.js updates order statuses (e.g., collected, on_the_way, delivered) by writing directly to Firestore (updateDoc(doc(db, 'orders', orderId), { orderStatus })). When the Firestore rules are locked down, this will break unless the rules explicitly allow drivers to update specific fields.

